<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal retail sales rose 12.8 pct mth/mth July.</title>
<headline>Portugal retail sales rose 12.8 pct mth/mth July.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal's retail sales index rose 12.8 percent in July from June and was 9.3 percent up on July last year, the National Statistics Institute (INE) said.</p>
<p>INE gave the following figures for retail sales:</p>
<p>				     July 96	 June 96	July 95</p>
<p>    Index (base 1990)	  154.8	   137.2	   141.6</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +(351-1) 3538254</p>
